cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Sorrel in your work, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
title: Sorrel
abstract: >-
  Sorrel is a native, high-performance GUI for manual curation of spike-sorted
  electrophysiology data, with a headless CLI for the same operations. It
  targets the phy workflow (cluster-by-cluster inspection, relabelling,
  merging, and splitting) on a Rust core that is generic over a data provider,
  with a wgpu-backed renderer.
authors:
